<title>USA: TABLE-Ahmanson Q2 diluted shr $1.01.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Ahmanson Q2 diluted shr $1.01.</headline>
<dateline>IRWINDALE, Calif. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>H.F. AHMANSON &amp; CO AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>	     CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL HIGHLIGHTS (Unaudited)</p>
<p>		(Dollars in thousands except per-share data)</p>
